    "detail": {
      "id": 1000985,
      "name": "[Affinity] Tempered Blade",
      "desc": "Komano has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>Beyond Dreams of the Past</color>.\nBeyond Dreams of the Past: When <color=#FFFFFF>Special Attack: Return to Ashes</color> hits a Stunned enemy, Manato gains 75 Blazing Heart and 4 stacks of Remnant Flame, and pressing <IconMap:Icon_Normal> will launch an <color=#FFFFFF>Assist Follow-Up</color>. This Remnant Flame effect can trigger once every 20s. When his <color=#FFFFFF>Assist Follow-Up</color> hits an enemy, Manato's <color=#FF5521>Fire DMG</color> increases by 3% for 8s, stacking up to 5 times. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
      "desc2": "Manato's body and soul are hardened by years of labor and countless brushes with death.\nSo rest assured, as long as he can still swing that heavy greatsword, he won't let danger come near you.",
      "class": {
        "31": "MEDAL"
      },
      "rarity": 4,
